{{#> base title="Security alert"}}
<p>Hello {{truncate name}},</p>
<p>A security change was made to your REDOVA account: <strong>{{eventLabel}}</strong>.</p>
<p>When: {{formatDate occurredAt}}{{#if ipAddress}}<br />From IP address: {{ipAddress}}{{/if}}</p>
<p>If this was you, no action is needed. If not, secure your account immediately.</p>
{{> button url=secureAccountUrl label="Secure my account"}}
{{/base}}
